 <section id="visual-system"><h2>The source visual system</h2><p>The PDF uses Poppins for headings, prompts and labels; Amiri for extended reading; occasional Minion Pro and handwritten fonts for special content. Handwritten diary artwork is retained with its existing text transcript. The new components use Poppins and Amiri with their bundled licenses.</p><p class="serif" lang="sq">Shoqëria dhe mjedisi. Mësojmë, hulumtojmë dhe bashkëpunojmë.</p><p>Headings: 28px desktop, 24px phone. Reading text: 22px desktop, 21px phone, 1.55–1.6 line height. Labels and inputs: 17–18px Poppins. Content width: 1000px maximum; margins: 56px desktop and 20px phone. No viewport-scaled type or negative tracking.</p><div class="swatches"><div><div class="swatch" style="background:#231f20"></div><strong>Reading ink</strong><br><code>#231f20</code></div><div><div class="swatch" style="background:#a15bb0"></div><strong>Source lesson purple</strong><br><code>#a15bb0</code></div><div><div class="swatch" style="background:#794282"></div><strong>AA purple for small white text</strong><br><code>#794282</code></div><div><div class="swatch" style="background:#794782"></div><strong>Cover purple</strong><br><code>#794782</code></div><div><div class="swatch" style="background:#99ced9"></div><strong>Reflection cyan</strong><br><code>#99ced9</code></div><div><div class="swatch" style="background:#a1cf75"></div><strong>Discussion green</strong><br><code>#a1cf75</code></div><div><div class="swatch" style="background:#fff4ce"></div><strong>Research yellow</strong><br><code>#fff4ce</code></div><div><div class="swatch" style="background:#ffac2c"></div><strong>Practice orange</strong><br><code>#ffac2c</code></div></div><p>Purple full-width lesson rules, outlined keyword strips, cyan thought panels, green discussion panels, pale yellow research notes and orange practice rules follow the source. Large white lesson titles retain the source purple; smaller white labels use a darker purple for AA contrast. Body text stays dark on light panels. Focus indicators use a dark teal outline.</p><p>Panels keep the source's soft corners while reading sections stay unframed. Figures retain their aspect ratio; then-and-now galleries preserve comparison order. Tables can scroll independently with a keyboard-focusable region. Source artwork is never replaced by a whole-page raster in the reader.</p></section>
